## About Brink Design

At Brink Design, we bring innovative, low-voltage solutions to homes and businesses across the region. From network cabling and security systems to audio-video installs and smart home automation, we deliver clean, reliable installs that are built to last.

## What We Do

- **Network & Cabling**: Wired for performance—data drops, patch panels, rack installs, and more.
- **Security Systems**: Cameras, access control, and monitoring setups to keep your property secure.
- **Audio-Video**: From conference rooms to churches, we handle full AV installs and upgrades.
- **Smart Home & Automation**: Connected lighting, thermostats, speakers, and controls that work together seamlessly.
- **Maintenance & Upgrades**: We offer troubleshooting, expansions, and system refreshes.

## Why Work With Us

We don’t just wire buildings—we create solutions that work for your space, your budget, and your goals. With attention to detail and a problem-solving mindset, we turn your ideas into innovative systems that just work.
